      text: <p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial">What we noticed</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial">Small changes gain traction when people can connect a local need with a choice they make every day.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial">Use this space for one verified observation and the people affected.</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 9669ab43c369381bee2ac581748d804cb38b838a7e94d7964437cc25c4645a5b
