      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial">How we respond</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial">Turn the observation into a practical action, name an owner and show the evidence the team will collect.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial">Keep the language concrete and the example human.</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 0fb760155ea0bc05680ef7fa0627e914da011145eccc25d65f92d5642024ff11
